## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Pickoff Default (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when the enemy can punish Kadita after Rough Waves returns her to the fight.; Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Use against healer, shield, or sustain drafts where Lifebane matters more than flat Magic Defense reduction.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use against chain control or early magic poke that can stop Kadita from reaching the flank.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

Default mid build for standard ranked games where Kadita needs reliable one-combo damage on the enemy backline.

### Snowball Execute (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Sky Piercer, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Sky Piercer, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Lightning Truncheon over Blood Wings when Use if Sky Piercer stacks are unstable and Kadita needs guaranteed burst plus cooldown reduction.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when the enemy has enough return damage to kill Kadita after the first execute attempt.; Wishing Lantern over Blood Wings when Use when the backline is protected by high-HP fighters and Kadita must add damage before the final dive.
- Total cost: 11260 gold

High-risk snowball setup for games where Kadita can repeatedly punish isolated targets and protect Sky Piercer stacks.

### Safe Flicker Engage (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Pull Yourself Together, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when the enemy lacks instant punish and Kadita can convert the defensive slot into shielded burst.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use in late Lord fights where a revive is more valuable than freezing in place after the combo.; Glowing Wand over Divine Glaive when Use against sustain lineups before they stack enough Magic Defense to require Divine Glaive.
- Total cost: 11840 gold

Safer engage build for CC-heavy games where Flicker angles and a single defensive active decide whether Kadita can start fights.

